THIRD-PARTY LICENSES
====================

Pricing Engines itself is MIT licensed — see LICENSE.

This file covers third-party material redistributed inside this repository.
Python dependencies (dash, dash-bootstrap-components, plotly, numpy, pandas,
scipy, flask, werkzeug and their transitive requirements) are not listed here:
pip fetches those at install time inside the container and their licenses ship
with them, so nothing of theirs is redistributed by this repo.

One stylesheet (a Bootswatch theme built on Bootstrap) and one typeface are
redistributed, and each is covered below. They are bundled so the calculators
make no network request for them.


